diff --git a/changelog/70135.added.md b/changelog/70135.added.md
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..5ed988a
--- /dev/null
+++ b/changelog/70135.added.md
@@ -0,0 +1,6 @@
+Added support for a ``min`` usage threshold to the ``diskusage`` beacon,
+alongside the existing ``max``/percent threshold. A mount can now be
+configured with ``{max: 90%, min: 10%}`` to alert both when usage climbs too
+high and when it unexpectedly drops too low, which usually indicates the
+filesystem failed to mount. Existing plain-percentage configuration
+(e.g. ``/: 63%``) continues to work unchanged.
